                                <li>
                                    <a href="#section-1-3" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">表空间情况</a>
                                    <ul class="pl-6 mt-1 space-y-1">
                                        <li><a href="#section-1-3-1" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">表空间状况信息</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-1-3-2" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">闪回空间使用情况</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-1-3-3" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">临时表空间使用情况</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-1-3-4" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">数据文件状况</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-1-3-5" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">控制文件</a></li>
                                    </ul>
