                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-2" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">物理读TOP10的SQL</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-3" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">执行时间TOP10的SQL</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-4" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">执行次数TOP10的SQL</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-5" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">解析次数TOP10的SQL</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-6" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">内存TOP10的SQL语句</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-7" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">DISK_SORT严重的SQL</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-8" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">执行时间最长SQL</a></li>
                                        <li><a href="#section-2-5-9" class="nav-item flex items-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-light text-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200">未使用绑定变量的SQL语句</a></li>
